{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7Jn4qk9dWtpmkpjqcT7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, I need a few answers. Each one changes what the summary can honestly say.\n\n1. **Where does the rest of the salary come from?** The attorney costs $78,000 a year and the foundation pays at most $45,000, so there's a $33,000 gap each year. Reviewers will look for it. Will county money, another grant or your general budget cover it, and is that money committed or still pending?\n\n2. **Is this a new position or a replacement?** If the third attorney mainly fills the seat of the one leaving in June, the grant keeps you at two lawyers rather than growing to three. That calls for a different argument: protecting your capacity instead of expanding it. Which June do you mean, and do you have funding to replace the departing attorney separately?\n\n3. **Where does the county contract stand?** Today is November 16, 2026, so \"up for renewal in October\" could mean last month or October 2027. Was it renewed, and is any of that $60,000 part of the plan for this position?\n\n4. **What does the foundation want to see?** Do they publish funding priorities, scoring criteria or required parts for the summary (for example need, activities, outcomes, sustainability)? If you can paste them, I'll match their wording and order.\n\n5. **What will a third attorney achieve, and what happens after two years?** For example, how many more tenants a year you expect to represent (my rough math from your caseloads is about 80 open cases at a time), and any plan to keep the position funded after the grant ends. Please also give me your clinic's name and county if you'd like them in the draft.\n\nIf you don't know some of these, say so and I'll write around them without guessing."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":9563,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":251},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"95427103-593d-4d06-bd1b-abbef2773e5f","uuid":"5589c1df-40d8-4c96-a22d-f401f123afca","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:21:13.117Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7Jn4bsTTYRogvdb5Giq"}
